{"id":27939,"slug":"chafed-elbows","title":"Chafed Elbows","year":1966,"country":"United States","duration":58,"spine":null,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/27939-chafed-elbows","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/3e73456f5c7208db818f141785bf900b/0rdTEhbswvC2ho9oNe9c6EmXIqG3Rw_large.jpg","description":"\nThis riot of bad taste was a breakthrough for Downey, thanks to rave notices. Visualized largely in still 35 mm photographs, it follows a shiftless downtown Manhattanite having his “annual November breakdown” as he wanders from one odd job to the next, coming across all sorts of sordid types, from a desperate independent filmmaker to a destitute dirty-sock sniffer. And there is something to offend everyone: incest, murder, bad pop songs, you name it.\nChafed Elbows was preserved by Anthology Film Archives, with funding provided by The Film Foundation.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Robert Downey Sr.","slug":"robert-downey-sr"}],"cast":[{"actor":"George Morgan","role":"Walter Dinsmore","slug":"george-morgan"},{"actor":"Elsie Downey","role":"All women's roles","slug":"elsie-downey"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Robert Downey Sr.","slug":"robert-downey-sr"},{"role":"Producer","person":"Robert Downey Sr.","slug":"robert-downey-sr"},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Robert Downey Sr.","slug":"robert-downey-sr"},{"role":"Cinematography","person":"William Waering","slug":null},{"role":"Cinematography","person":"Stan Warnow","slug":null},{"role":"Cinematography","person":"Robert Prince","slug":null},{"role":"Editors","person":"Robert Prince","slug":null},{"role":"Editors","person":"Robert Soukis","slug":"robert-soukis"},{"role":"Track analysis and film editing","person":"Fred von Bernewitz","slug":null},{"role":"Music","person":"Tom O'Horgan","slug":null},{"role":"Special hindrance","person":"New York City Police Department","slug":null}],"pickedBy":[],"related":[500,408,27941],"setFilms":[],"inSets":[1000887]}